/**
 * Lot furniture in the coloured set's world coordinates.
 *
 * Shares the coloured houses' origin and unit, so it is placed with the
 * same transform and no per-piece fitting. The line furniture is not here:
 * it is centred on its own bounding box, which discards where each piece
 * stood, and cannot be placed until an anchor list arrives.
 */
